sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API
    participant S as AdvisorService
    participant K as Knowledge
    participant M as AI Provider
    participant R as Repository
    participant E as Events
    C->>A: POST /v1/requests
    A->>S: submit(question, criticality)
    S->>R: save(received)
    S->>K: search approved sources
    alt critical or no approved source
        S->>R: save(human_review)
    else safe to process
        S->>M: generate(question, sources)
        M-->>S: recommendation
        S->>R: save(completed)
    end
    S->>E: publish outcome
    S-->>A: advisory result
    A-->>C: 201 + request ID
